---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
---

<PolicyPage
  title="Accessibility Statement"
  intro="Mo Lumen Astrology is being built toward WCAG 2.2 Level AA, with ongoing automated and manual review."
  ><h2>Our approach</h2><p>
    The staging site uses semantic structure, keyboard-operable navigation and tools, visible focus,
    reduced-motion support, responsive reflow, text alternatives, and plain-language instructions.
  </p><h2>Known limits</h2><p>
    Third-party booking, payment, newsletter, and media experiences must be tested after real
    integrations are configured. No claim of perfect accessibility is made.
  </p><h2>Contact</h2><p>
    If something prevents you from using the site, email <a href="mailto:mo@molumen.com"
      >mo@molumen.com</a
    > and describe the page and assistance you need.
  </p></PolicyPage
>
